    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Always with you&quot;</strong> is an action-adventure puzzle game where you play as a clever and courageous young girl embarking on a journey to find her mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient civilization sends out a mysterious call. The protagonist, alongside three uniquely spirited cats, explores ancient ruins, switching between the girl and the cats to push stones, slip through gaps, and overcome numerous challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dense forests, dive into the deep sea, and visit the Alto civilization to uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 meticulously designed puzzles and mechanisms will test your wits and observation skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control three distinct feline companions, utilizing their special abilities to clear obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guardians of Alto will stand in your way\u2014defeat them with wisdom and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between the girl and the cats for a unique gameplay experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in thrilling battles against powerful bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make use of the cats\u2019 unique abilities to navigate challenges.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve a variety of intricate puzzles and mechanisms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure in &quot;Journey with Cats&quot;, travel to the Alto civilization, and help Mia uncover her mother\u2019s whereabouts. A wide range of achievements awaits players\u2014set off on this journey with your three feline companions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Always with you&quot;</strong> is an action-adventure puzzle game where you play as a clever and courageous young girl embarking on a journey to find her mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient civilization sends out a mysterious call. The protagonist, alongside three uniquely spirited cats, explores ancient ruins, switching between the girl and the cats to push stones, slip through gaps, and overcome numerous challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dense forests, dive into the deep sea, and visit the Alto civilization to uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4fd1406d93da840daa003591de07896f.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 meticulously designed puzzles and mechanisms will test your wits and observation skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/caf9f313f43adf8e15299d1cfb00b0a4.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control three distinct feline companions, utilizing their special abilities to clear obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/33e342f6a6eb5821825609c7b4be3962.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guardians of Alto will stand in your way\u2014defeat them with wisdom and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.poster.avif?t=1754562133\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.webm?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437190/extras/4145524a4f1cf3e27c20ae0461828a86.mp4?t=1754562133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between the girl and the cats for a unique gameplay experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in thrilling battles against powerful bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make use of the cats\u2019 unique abilities to navigate challenges.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve a variety of intricate puzzles and mechanisms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure in &quot;Journey with Cats&quot;, travel to the Alto civilization, and help Mia uncover her mother\u2019s whereabouts. A wide range of achievements awaits players\u2014set off on this journey with your three feline companions!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Always with you&quot; is a cute and relaxing action-puzzle game. Switch freely between controlling a girl and a cat, solve clever puzzles, explore the ancient Alto civilization, and defeat unruly guardians. Embark on an exciting adventure with three cats to find your mother!",
